@startuml git-support-component
title Git Support v1 — Component Overview

package "ide-core" {
  [Project] as Project
  [GitRepo] as GitRepo
  [git2 (libgit2)] as Git2
}

package "ide-ui" {
  [IdeApp] as IdeApp
  [GitPanel] as GitPanel
}

database "Working tree\n(.git + files on disk)" as Disk

IdeApp --> Project : project.root()
IdeApp --> GitPanel : view-mode toggle\n"Source Control"
GitPanel --> GitRepo : commit_graph()\ndiff_file() / diff_commit()\nconflicts() / conflict_sides()\nresolve_conflict()
GitRepo --> Git2 : wraps
GitRepo ..> Project : opened from project.root()
Git2 --> Disk : read commits/trees/index\nwrite resolved file + stage

note right of GitRepo
  No subprocess execution, no
  network I/O. All access is
  through the git2 library API.
end note

@enduml
